        "created_at": "2021-05-09T23:18:43.419Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Small companies are notorious for not having backfills ready for key employees. This isn’t necessarily they can do something about, with overall less cash on hand than a bigger company to pay for a deep bench in each needed subject area.</p>",
