      {
        "id": 237365,
        "name": "Blackfang108",
        "username": "Blackfang108",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/74df32/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2021-05-10T20:36:44.754Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’ll mostly note that we were told it was in “Final build” along with the Xbox port in June 2020, and the Xbox build got released in October of that year.</p>\n<p>So it’s just a bit maddening that, after another 6 months, they were still “working with Sony” to get it released, until suddenly on May 3 they were completely unable to move forward with the port.  It makes every update from June on seem… overly optimistic at best.</p>\n<p>In related news: I just got my Switch key a bit ago.</p>\n<p>And the Switch eShop is under maintenance.</p>\n<p>Because of course it is.  XD</p>",
        "post_number": 23,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-05-10T20:36:44.754Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
