        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/74df32/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2021-05-11T15:10:06.010Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was able to download and play a bit last night.</p>\n<p>My first impressions through the prologue and character creation: It definitely gets that “Comic book” feel down.</p>\n<p>Character creation has a lot of options, almost too many.</p>\n<p>The dialogue choices felt like a good spread of options.</p>",
