        "created_at": "2021-05-11T19:17:47.107Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was playing it in handheld mode while watching Leverage with my wife, so I can’t speak to the audio aspects.</p>\n<p>I’ll look forward to playing it on the tv, after that glowing review, though.</p>",
