      {
        "id": 237390,
        "name": "Jeysie",
        "username": "Jeysie",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-05-11T20:15:12.545Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"MindWanderer\" data-post=\"28\" data-topic=\"20462\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/48/4816_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MindWanderer:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>There are no voice acting credits? What is this, the '90’s? For shame.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I know, right? One more gripe on the pile. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=12\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>We do know Joe Zieja, of course, and Adam stated on this past LP cover stream that the real life Pete which Setback is based on, actually voiced Setback in SoF.</p>",
